{"4450330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "StackHead", "steam_appid": 4450330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackhead</strong> is a fast-paced 2.5D platformer shooter inspired by classic action platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/56732bb6d2627d1f2ef53a7a920b25ab.poster.avif?t=1773649542\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/56732bb6d2627d1f2ef53a7a920b25ab.webm?t=1773649542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/56732bb6d2627d1f2ef53a7a920b25ab.mp4?t=1773649542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Stackhead, a maintenance worker at Automa Park, a massive AI-controlled amusement park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhappy with his job and tired of being reprimanded whenever he tries to entertain visitors, Stackhead decides to rebel. He jumps from attraction to attraction to put on a show for the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The park’s AI doesn’t appreciate his initiative and sends waves of robots to stop him — but the chaos only makes the audience cheer louder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through diverse attractions, defeat robotic enemies, and explore the park as you make your way toward the AI’s headquarters for a spectacular final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/c44bbfa7fd68b72912c6cca9b796a7c9.avif?t=1773649542\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay &amp; Key Selling Point</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As his name suggests, Stackhead can <strong>stack machines on top of his head</strong> by collecting them from defeated enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you build a towering arsenal of weapons, transforming into a walking weapon tower — all while staying true to the amusement park theme with bouncing ball shots, water bombs, and other playful yet destructive attractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique <strong>Stacking mechanic</strong> is the core gameplay system and the game’s main feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/9c052af6bd1ac833b63aa9054a3f447c.poster.avif?t=1773649542\" width=260 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/9c052af6bd1ac833b63aa9054a3f447c.webm?t=1773649542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/9c052af6bd1ac833b63aa9054a3f447c.mp4?t=1773649542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROUSSIN Mickaël</strong> : Game Designer – Sound Designer – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALLÈGRE Max-Emilien</strong> : Texture Artist – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CIRRONIS Emanuele</strong> : Programmer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAVOYE-SOL Matias</strong> : Programmer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATAILLE Arthur</strong> : 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORQUIN Jules</strong> : VFX Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BELLANDE Aurélie</strong> : Concept Artist – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAFAGE Benjamin</strong> : Concept Artist – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DONADILLE Marion</strong> : VFX Artist – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JAUZE Lauriane</strong> : Level Design – Narrative Design – 3D Artist – Level Artist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Students game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>STACKHEAD is a french student game from the ESMA Game school created in 9 months by a team of 10 students, working with the technical constraints for a portable console.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/5516899e315408b6dd05277c66f77fee.avif?t=1773649542\" width=321 height=324 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackhead</strong> is a fast-paced 2.5D platformer shooter inspired by classic action platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/56732bb6d2627d1f2ef53a7a920b25ab.poster.avif?t=1773649542\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/56732bb6d2627d1f2ef53a7a920b25ab.webm?t=1773649542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/56732bb6d2627d1f2ef53a7a920b25ab.mp4?t=1773649542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Stackhead, a maintenance worker at Automa Park, a massive AI-controlled amusement park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhappy with his job and tired of being reprimanded whenever he tries to entertain visitors, Stackhead decides to rebel. He jumps from attraction to attraction to put on a show for the crowd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The park’s AI doesn’t appreciate his initiative and sends waves of robots to stop him — but the chaos only makes the audience cheer louder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through diverse attractions, defeat robotic enemies, and explore the park as you make your way toward the AI’s headquarters for a spectacular final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/c44bbfa7fd68b72912c6cca9b796a7c9.avif?t=1773649542\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay &amp; Key Selling Point</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As his name suggests, Stackhead can <strong>stack machines on top of his head</strong> by collecting them from defeated enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you build a towering arsenal of weapons, transforming into a walking weapon tower — all while staying true to the amusement park theme with bouncing ball shots, water bombs, and other playful yet destructive attractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique <strong>Stacking mechanic</strong> is the core gameplay system and the game’s main feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/9c052af6bd1ac833b63aa9054a3f447c.poster.avif?t=1773649542\" width=260 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/9c052af6bd1ac833b63aa9054a3f447c.webm?t=1773649542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/9c052af6bd1ac833b63aa9054a3f447c.mp4?t=1773649542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROUSSIN Mickaël</strong> : Game Designer – Sound Designer – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALLÈGRE Max-Emilien</strong> : Texture Artist – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CIRRONIS Emanuele</strong> : Programmer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAVOYE-SOL Matias</strong> : Programmer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATAILLE Arthur</strong> : 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MORQUIN Jules</strong> : VFX Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BELLANDE Aurélie</strong> : Concept Artist – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAFAGE Benjamin</strong> : Concept Artist – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DONADILLE Marion</strong> : VFX Artist – 3D Artist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JAUZE Lauriane</strong> : Level Design – Narrative Design – 3D Artist – Level Artist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Students game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>STACKHEAD is a french student game from the ESMA Game school created in 9 months by a team of 10 students, working with the technical constraints for a portable console.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/extras/5516899e315408b6dd05277c66f77fee.avif?t=1773649542\" width=321 height=324 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Stackhead is a fast-paced 2.5D platformer shooter. In a too-perfect amusement park, StackHead, a maintenance robot, is tired of the monotony of the park. He decides to explore the attractions, facing robots controlled by AI and bringing surprise and delight wherever he goes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/51b3439bb2113afaf79b34be68794c3d50512f0b/header.jpg?t=1773649542", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/a35d556eeb860240544061514ad442c6c58284c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773649542", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450330/a35d556eeb860240544061514ad442c6c58284c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773649542", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 ou AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 380 (2 GB VRAM minimum)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 ou AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6 GB) / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["ESMA - Ecoles Creatives"], "publishers": ["ESMA - Ecoles Creatives"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Act